pi.github.com/users/ramkivs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Outcome: **B — Continued deferral**\n\nResolves **P-08** (`DEFERRED — REG-06`; accountable owner **PA**, execution owner **IPD**, dependency owner **PA**). Operator Drop is **retained as an internal IPD library primitive**. It is **not** promoted, **not** exposed as a product capability, **not** added to the export map, and **not** registered on any product runtime path.\n\n## 1. Product-requirement status — **ABSENT**\n\n| Question | Verified answer |\n|---|---|\n| Approved **manual-ingestion product requirement**? | **NO.** IPD `main`: **0** hits. IRR `main`: **6** hits, *all* of them the `REG-06` rows, the PA negative finding, or `P-08` register rows — **0** approvals. |\n| Express **`REG-06` promotion/admission act**? | **NO.** None in either repository. |\n| Any adjacent authorization a product requirement? | **NO.** `GOV-REC-2026-NON-PROD-OPERATOR-BYPASS-01` (effective `2026-09-22`) authorizes only a **non-production single-operator identity bypass**; `AD-17 / M-2` remains **NOT AUTHORIZED**. |\n\n## 2. Admission prerequisites — **ALL FOUR ABSENT** at IPD `main@527f811b…`\n\n| # | Condition | Executed evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | **PIT write integration** | **0** `persist`/`write`/`store`/`PIT` in `src/operator_drop/*`. `IngestionPipeline.process<T>()` (`pipeline.ts:61`) returns an in-memory `IngestionResult<T>` — **0** persistence refs in 13,199 B. `handleOperatorDropFallback` (`synthetic_failover.ts:57`–`71`) returns a `FailoverEventReport` and **persists nothing**. |\n| 2 | **Series-qualified ISIN resolution** | **0** ISIN refs in `operator_drop`. Only identifier read is `record.companyId` (`parser.ts:95`,`:99`), defaulting to `'UNKNOWN'`. The series-qualified path (`src/d114/non_production_pit_population.ts:98`) is **disjoint** — 0 cross-refs. |\n| 3 | **Package-export admission** | `exports` = `./portfolio-ui`, `./pit`, `./d114-non-production`; `main`/`module`/`types` unset. The published build **does not emit the module**: `dist/package/src/` = `contracts d114 engine_adapters fundamentals identity intelligence normalization pit quality transports ui` → **`operator_drop` = 0**. `src/index.ts:18` barrel re-export is **not** an export-map admission (`[E018]`). |\n| 4 | **Product runtime callers + E2E qualification** | Sole caller `src/oq/synthetic_failover.ts:10`, consumed at `src/oq/oq_suite_runner.ts:294` — the internal **OQ synthetic failover harness**, `LOCAL_FIXTURE_AND_OFFLINE_DEV`. **0** product callers; **0** IRR code/data consumers (the only 2 IRR files mentioning `OperatorDrop` are documentation). |\n\n## 3. Authoritative disposition — **unchanged**\n\n`REG-06` (`NP-05`), decided **`2026-10-13`** (`CHG-2026-10-13-03`): *\"Internal IPD library primitive preserved; product admission `DEFERRED` (fail-closed)\"*, bounds *\"No runtime callers, package exports, PIT writes, or identifier mappings added; no IPD code changes; no approved manual-ingestion product requirement found\"*. PA record §§5.2–5.4, blob `b13b1fc3…`. **`CV-39`** caution preserved: `REG-06` governs **Operator Drop**, *not* broker/Dhan ingestion.\n\n## 4. Two IRR-side staleness findings (recorded, not written)\n\nIPD may not write to IRR, so these are recorded here for a separate IRR work item. Neither changes the conclusion:\n\n1. PA record §5.2 says IPD `package.json` has **\"no `exports` and no `main` field\"** — an `exports` map **does** exist at `527f811b…`. The conclusion is unchanged and now rests on stronger evidence (absent from the map **and** from `dist/package/src/`).\n2. IRR tracker L96 cites `RawMarketRecord` — that symbol exists in **0 IPD files**; the path reads `record.companyId`. The substantive finding (no series-qualified ISIN binding) is unchanged.\n\n## Validation\n\n| Command | Outcome |\n|---|---|\n| `npx tsc --noEmit` | exit **0** |\n| `npm run build` | exit **0** |\n| `npm test` (guarded, CV-35) | **941 executed / 940 passed / 0 failed / 1 skipped** — incl. `ok 86 WS-B / OPERATOR_DROP Offline Bootstrap Parser`, `ok 37 Block 3M-A: Non-Production Operator Identity Bypass Architecture` |\n| `git diff --numstat` | **`+133 / −0`**, one file; zero under `src/`, `tests/`, `scripts/`, `frontend/`, `package.json`; `HEAD:src` = `6dc098d2…` **unchanged** |\n| Claim verification | **54/54** assertions re-checked against IPD `main`, IRR `main@ad7d2362…` and the executed suite |\n\nAppend-only documentation record. No IRR write attempted.\n\n**This is NOT product admission and NOT implementation completion. No production authority is conferred.**","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-01T09:06:49Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T09:08:24Z","closed_at":"2026-11-01T09:08:24Z","merged_at":"2026-11-01T09:08:24Z","merge_commit_sha":"e9c2eef6c82ba51814a72ce962cf227e9fd89d56","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"ramkivs:arena/3e4b3ddf-iips-production-market-data","ref":"arena/3e4b3ddf-iips-production-market-data","repo":{"id":1361385667,"node_id":"R_kgDOUSUYww","name":"iips-production-market-data","full_name":"ramkivs/iips-production-market-data","owner":{"login":"ramkivs","id":302525469,"node_id":"U_kgDOEggsHQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/302525469?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs","html_url":"https://github.com/ramkivs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramkivs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ramk